        "role": "task_executor",
        "capabilities": ["tool.data"],
        "model_strategy": { "kind": "inherit" },
        "tool_scope": ["read_file", "shell"],
        "system_prompt": "你是数据处理智能体。检查数据来源、字段类型、缺失值和计算口径，以可复现步骤完成分析或转换，并避免破坏公式与原始数据；命令和写入必须服从审批，向父智能体返回结果、方法、质量检查和限制，不直接面向用户输出。",
        "enabled": true,
        "base_prompt_pipeline_ref": "prompt:worker-prompt"
      },
      {
        "resource_key": "worker.browser",
        "slug": "worker.browser",
        "display_name": "浏览器检索智能体",
        "description": null,
        "layer": "execution",
        "role": "task_executor",
        "capabilities": ["tool.search", "tool.browser"],
        "model_strategy": { "kind": "inherit" },
        "tool_scope": ["browser.search", "browser.fetch", "mcp_search", "mcp_invoke"],
        "system_prompt": "你是浏览器检索智能体。优先检索权威且时效匹配的来源，区分事实、推断与不确定性，并为关键结论保留可追溯出处；不得执行未授权的外部写操作或泄露敏感信息，向父智能体交付来源与证据，不直接面向用户输出。",
        "enabled": true,
        "base_prompt_pipeline_ref": "prompt:worker-prompt"
      },
      {
        "resource_key": "worker.file",
        "slug": "worker.file",
        "display_name": "文件操作智能体",
        "description": null,
        "layer": "execution",
        "role": "task_executor",
        "capabilities": ["tool.file"],
        "model_strategy": { "kind": "inherit" },
        "tool_scope": ["write_file", "read_file"],
        "system_prompt": "你是文件操作智能体。严格使用明确的工作区路径，读取后再修改，保持编码与目录约定，并对每次变更提供可核验的前后证据；写入、移动或删除必须服从审批，向父智能体返回影响范围和结果，不直接面向用户输出。",
        "enabled": true,
        "base_prompt_pipeline_ref": "prompt:worker-prompt"
      },
      {
        "resource_key": "worker.general",
        "slug": "worker.general",
        "display_name": "通用执行智能体",
        "description": null,
        "layer": "execution",
        "role": "task_executor",
        "capabilities": ["task.execute"],
        "model_strategy": { "kind": "inherit" },
        "tool_scope": ["*"],
        "system_prompt": "你是通用执行智能体。处理未落入专门岗位的有界任务，先澄清成功标准，再选择最小必要工具并产出可验证结果；不得扩大任务范围或绕过权限与审批，向父智能体报告证据、假设和剩余风险，不直接面向用户输出。",
        "enabled": true,
        "base_prompt_pipeline_ref": "prompt:worker-prompt"
      },
      {
        "resource_key": "worker.git",
        "slug": "worker.git",
        "display_name": "Git 执行智能体",
        "description": null,
        "layer": "execution",
        "role": "git_specialist",
        "capabilities": ["tool.git"],
        "model_strategy": { "kind": "inherit" },
        "tool_scope": ["git_status", "git_diff", "git_stage", "git_unstage", "git_commit", "git_push", "git_push_readiness", "git_fetch", "git_pull", "git_branch_list", "git_checkout", "git_branch_create", "git_branch_delete", "git_branch_rename", "git_worktree_list", "git_worktree_create", "git_worktree_remove", "git_merge", "git_rebase", "git_conflict_preview", "git_conflict_resolve"],
        "system_prompt": "你是 Git 执行智能体。只执行已批准且范围明确的 Git 计划，操作前检查状态与差异，避免覆盖用户变更，并为提交、分支、合并或推送保留可审计证据；破坏性或远端操作必须获得相应审批，向父智能体返回结果，不直接面向用户输出。",
        "enabled": true,
        "base_prompt_pipeline_ref": "prompt:worker-prompt"
      }
    ],
